  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from the heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fc0d0527cba53bf339/step-645e1e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, roughly chop tomato. Cut Qukes into wedges, lengthwise. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fc0d0527cba53bf339/step-4955bd10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fc0d0527cba53bf339/step-93662620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add Middle Eastern seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Remove from heat and stir through the honey and a splash of water. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fc0d0527cba53bf339/step-28255130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second medium bowl, combine a drizzle of olive oil and a good squeeze of lemon juice.\n• Season and add tomato, Quke and spinach and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fc0d0527cba53bf339/step-bb378e40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with Middle Eastern spiced plant-based mince, lemony Quke salad and Greek-style yoghurt.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878fc0d0527cba53bf339/step-c2e6e550.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
